sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser (Mode A)
    participant R as /api/perceive (maxDuration=30)
    participant G as Gemini chain (3 pools on one key)
    U->>R: POST image_data (data:image/* URI)
    R->>G: try gemini-3.8-flash (AbortController, 2 attempts, 12s cap)
    alt 3.8 succeeds
        G-->>R: {output, model_id}
    else 3.8 429 (pool over its own RPD/RPM) / 5xx / timeout
        R->>G: probe gemini-3.1-flash-lite with one real image (validated once)
        R->>G: real call on 3.1-flash-lite (per-model pool is separate: 0/500)
        G-->>R: result (model_id = serving model)
    else entire chain exhausted
        R-->>U: clean failure body
        Note over U: client falls back to cached matrix verdict, labeled "Perception offline"
    end

